{"seq":4,"slug":"profiling-and-devtools","title":"性能分析与 DevTools","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/profiling-and-devtools","wordCount":849,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能分析与-devtools\">性能分析与 DevTools</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能优化必须以测量为前提，React 提供了多层次的性能分析工具：内置的 Profiler API 可程序化测量渲染耗时，React DevTools Profiler 可视化火焰图与重渲染，why-did-you-render 自动标记不必要的重渲染，Chrome Performance 面板则覆盖非 React 特有的长任务与布局抖动。本章讲解这些工具的使用方式与适用边界，并给出「测量 → 定位 → 优化 → 验证」的决策流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"react-性能分析工具概览\">React 性能分析工具概览</h2><p>React 提供了多层次的性能分析工具，从内置的 Profiler API 到浏览器 DevTools 扩展，帮助开发者定位和解决性能瓶颈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[发现性能问题] --&gt; B{问题类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|哪些组件重渲染了| C[React DevTools Profiler]&#10;    B --&gt;|为什么重渲染| D[why-did-you-render]&#10;    B --&gt;|渲染耗时分析| E[React Profiler API]&#10;    B --&gt;|整体运行时性能| F[Chrome Performance]&#10;    B --&gt;|生产环境监控| G[Web Vitals + RUM]\">flowchart TD\n    A[发现性能问题] --&gt; B{问题类型?}\n    B --&gt;|哪些组件重渲染了| C[React DevTools Profiler]\n    B --&gt;|为什么重渲染| D[why-did-you-render]\n    B --&gt;|渲染耗时分析| E[React Profiler API]\n    B --&gt;|整体运行时性能| F[Chrome Performance]\n    B --&gt;|生产环境监控| G[Web Vitals + RUM]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-profiler-api\">React Profiler API</h2><p>React 内置的 <code>&lt;Profiler&gt;</code> 组件用于程序化地测量渲染性能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { Profiler, ProfilerOnRenderCallback } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;const onRender: ProfilerOnRenderCallback = (id, phase, actualDuration, baseDuration, startTime, commitTime) =&gt; {&#10;  console.table({&#10;    id,&#10;    phase,&#10;    actualDuration: `${actualDuration.toFixed(2)}ms`,&#10;    baseDuration: `${baseDuration.toFixed(2)}ms`,&#10;    startTime: `${startTime.toFixed(2)}ms`,&#10;    commitTime: `${commitTime.toFixed(2)}ms`,&#10;  });&#10;};&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Profiler id=&quot;Header&quot; onRender={onRender}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Profiler&gt;&#10;      &lt;Profiler id=&quot;MainContent&quot; onRender={onRender}&gt;&#10;        &lt;MainContent /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Profiler&gt;&#10;      &lt;Profiler id=&quot;Sidebar&quot; onRender={onRender}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Sidebar /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Profiler&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Profiler, ProfilerOnRenderCallback } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const onRender: ProfilerOnRenderCallback = (id, phase, actualDuration, baseDuration, startTime, commitTime) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.table({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    phase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actualDuration: `${actualDuration.toFixed(2)}ms`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    baseDuration: `${baseDuration.toFixed(2)}ms`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startTime: `${startTime.toFixed(2)}ms`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    commitTime: `${commitTime.toFixed(2)}ms`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Profiler id=\"Header\" onRender={onRender}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Profiler></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Profiler id=\"MainContent\" onRender={onRender}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;MainContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Profiler></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Profiler id=\"Sidebar\" onRender={onRender}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Sidebar /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Profiler></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>id</code></td>\n<td>Profiler 标识符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>phase</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;mount&quot;</code> 或 <code>&quot;update&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>actualDuration</code></td>\n<td>本次渲染实际耗时（ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>baseDuration</code></td>\n<td>无 memoization 时的预估耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>startTime</code></td>\n<td>本次渲染开始的时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>commitTime</code></td>\n<td>本次 Commit 的时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"生产环境性能收集\">生产环境性能收集</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const onRender: ProfilerOnRenderCallback = (id, phase, actualDuration) =&gt; {&#10;  if (actualDuration &gt; 16) {&#10;    reportPerformanceMetric({&#10;      component: id,&#10;      phase,&#10;      duration: actualDuration,&#10;      timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const onRender: ProfilerOnRenderCallback = (id, phase, actualDuration) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (actualDuration > 16) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    reportPerformanceMetric({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      component: id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      phase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      duration: actualDuration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      timestamp: Date.now(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Profiler 在生产构建中默认禁用。如需在生产环境收集数据，使用 <code>react-dom/profiling</code> 构建包。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-devtools-profiler\">React DevTools Profiler</h2><p>React DevTools 的 Profiler 标签页提供了可视化的渲染分析：</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用步骤\">使用步骤</h3><ol>\n<li>打开 React DevTools → Profiler 标签</li>\n<li>点击录制按钮</li>\n<li>执行需要分析的操作</li>\n<li>停止录制</li>\n<li>分析 Flame Chart 和 Ranked Chart</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"flame-chart\">Flame Chart</h3><p>火焰图显示每个组件在每次 Commit 中的渲染耗时。颜色越深表示渲染耗时越长：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;App (2.1ms)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;Header (0.3ms)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;ProductList (15.2ms) 🔴&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Footer (0.1ms)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;ProductCard #1 (1.2ms)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;ProductCard #2 (1.1ms)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;... x50&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H[&quot;FilterBar (5.3ms) 🟡&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"App (2.1ms)\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"Header (0.3ms)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"ProductList (15.2ms) 🔴\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Footer (0.1ms)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"ProductCard #1 (1.2ms)\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"ProductCard #2 (1.1ms)\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"... x50\"]\n    C --&gt; H[\"FilterBar (5.3ms) 🟡\"]</pre><h3 id=\"ranked-chart\">Ranked Chart</h3><p>排名图按渲染耗时从长到短排列组件，快速定位最慢的组件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高亮重渲染\">高亮重渲染</h3><p>在 React DevTools 的 Settings 中开启 <strong>&quot;Highlight updates when components render&quot;</strong>，可以在页面上实时看到哪些组件正在重渲染（以闪烁的边框标示）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边框颜色</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蓝色</td>\n<td>低频更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿色</td>\n<td>中频更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄色/红色</td>\n<td>高频更新（可能需要优化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"why-did-you-render\">why-did-you-render</h2><p><code>@welldone-software/why-did-you-render</code> 是一个第三方库，能够自动检测和报告不必要的重渲染原因：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// wdyr.ts — 在应用入口最前面导入&#10;import React from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;if (process.env.NODE_ENV === &#39;development&#39;) {&#10;  const whyDidYouRender = require(&#39;@welldone-software/why-did-you-render&#39;);&#10;  whyDidYouRender(React, {&#10;    trackAllPureComponents: true,&#10;    trackHooks: true,&#10;    logOnDifferentValues: true,&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 对特定组件开启追踪&#10;function ExpensiveComponent({ data }: { data: DataType }) {&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{/* ... */}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;ExpensiveComponent.whyDidYouRender = true;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// wdyr.ts — 在应用入口最前面导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import React from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'development') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const whyDidYouRender = require('@welldone-software/why-did-you-render');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  whyDidYouRender(React, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    trackAllPureComponents: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    trackHooks: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logOnDifferentValues: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 对特定组件开启追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ExpensiveComponent({ data }: { data: DataType }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{/* ... */}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ExpensiveComponent.whyDidYouRender = true;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"ExpensiveComponent re-rendered because:&#10;  Props changes:&#10;    - data: { old value } !== { new value }&#10;      (different objects that are equal by value)&#10;&#10;  Suggestion: Use React.memo or useMemo to prevent re-renders\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ExpensiveComponent re-rendered because:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Props changes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - data: { old value } !== { new value }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (different objects that are equal by value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Suggestion: Use React.memo or useMemo to prevent re-renders</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相同值的新对象</td>\n<td>对象内容一样但引用不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相同值的新数组</td>\n<td>数组内容一样但引用不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相同值的新函数</td>\n<td>每次渲染创建的新函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hooks 依赖变化</td>\n<td>哪个 Hook 的依赖导致了重渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"chrome-performance-面板\">Chrome Performance 面板</h2><p>对于非 React 特有的性能问题（长任务、布局抖动等），使用 Chrome DevTools 的 Performance 面板：</p>\n<h3 id=\"关键指标\">关键指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Long Task</td>\n<td>超过 50ms 的任务</td>\n<td>尽量消除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layout Shift</td>\n<td>布局偏移</td>\n<td>CLS &lt; 0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FCP</td>\n<td>首次内容绘制</td>\n<td>&lt; 1.8s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>最大内容绘制</td>\n<td>&lt; 2.5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP</td>\n<td>交互到下一次绘制</td>\n<td>&lt; 200ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"录制分析流程\">录制分析流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[打开 Performance 面板] --&gt; B[点击录制]&#10;    B --&gt; C[执行操作: 点击/滚动/输入]&#10;    C --&gt; D[停止录制]&#10;    D --&gt; E[查看 Main 线程时间线]&#10;    E --&gt; F{发现长任务?}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[展开查看调用栈]&#10;    G --&gt; H[定位具体函数]&#10;    H --&gt; I[优化: memo/虚拟列表/Web Worker]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; J[查看 Network 面板]&#10;    J --&gt; K[优化加载策略]\">flowchart TD\n    A[打开 Performance 面板] --&gt; B[点击录制]\n    B --&gt; C[执行操作: 点击/滚动/输入]\n    C --&gt; D[停止录制]\n    D --&gt; E[查看 Main 线程时间线]\n    E --&gt; F{发现长任务?}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[展开查看调用栈]\n    G --&gt; H[定位具体函数]\n    H --&gt; I[优化: memo/虚拟列表/Web Worker]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; J[查看 Network 面板]\n    J --&gt; K[优化加载策略]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化决策树\">性能优化决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[性能问题] --&gt; B{初始加载慢?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[代码分割 + 预加载]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D{交互响应慢?}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E{组件重渲染?}&#10;    E -- 是 --&gt; F[React.memo + useCallback]&#10;    E -- 否 --&gt; G{JS 计算量大?}&#10;    G -- 是 --&gt; H[Web Worker / useMemo]&#10;    G -- 否 --&gt; I{DOM 节点过多?}&#10;    I -- 是 --&gt; J[虚拟列表]&#10;    I -- 否 --&gt; K[检查布局抖动/样式]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; L{滚动卡顿?}&#10;    L -- 是 --&gt; M[虚拟列表 + CSS contain]&#10;    L -- 否 --&gt; N[使用 Profiler 精确定位]\">flowchart TD\n    A[性能问题] --&gt; B{初始加载慢?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[代码分割 + 预加载]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D{交互响应慢?}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E{组件重渲染?}\n    E -- 是 --&gt; F[React.memo + useCallback]\n    E -- 否 --&gt; G{JS 计算量大?}\n    G -- 是 --&gt; H[Web Worker / useMemo]\n    G -- 否 --&gt; I{DOM 节点过多?}\n    I -- 是 --&gt; J[虚拟列表]\n    I -- 否 --&gt; K[检查布局抖动/样式]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; L{滚动卡顿?}\n    L -- 是 --&gt; M[虚拟列表 + CSS contain]\n    L -- 否 --&gt; N[使用 Profiler 精确定位]</pre><h3 id=\"综合优化实践\">综合优化实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const HeavyPage = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./HeavyPage&#39;));&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Profiler id=&quot;App&quot; onRender={reportToAnalytics}&gt;&#10;      &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;ErrorPage /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;PageSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;          &lt;HeavyPage /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Profiler&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const DataList = memo(function DataList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Virtuoso&#10;      style={{ height: 600 }}&#10;      totalCount={items.length}&#10;      itemContent={(index) =&gt; &lt;ItemCard item={items[index]} /&gt;}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});&#10;&#10;const ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({ item }: { item: Item }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;h3&gt;{item.title}&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{item.description}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const HeavyPage = lazy(() => import('./HeavyPage'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Profiler id=\"App\" onRender={reportToAnalytics}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;ErrorPage />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;PageSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;HeavyPage /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Profiler></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const DataList = memo(function DataList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Virtuoso</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{ height: 600 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      totalCount={items.length}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      itemContent={(index) => &#x3C;ItemCard item={items[index]} />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({ item }: { item: Item }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h3>{item.title}&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>{item.description}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 性能优化要以数据为依据，不要凭猜测。先使用 Profiler 和 DevTools 定位瓶颈，再针对性优化。过早优化是万恶之源。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>React Profiler API</strong> 程序化测量渲染性能，支持生产环境监控</li>\n<li><strong>React DevTools Profiler</strong> 可视化分析火焰图和排名图，高亮重渲染</li>\n<li><strong>why-did-you-render</strong> 自动检测不必要的重渲染并给出优化建议</li>\n<li><strong>Chrome Performance</strong> 面板用于分析非 React 特有的性能问题（长任务、布局抖动）</li>\n<li>性能优化遵循<strong>测量 → 定位 → 优化 → 验证</strong>的循环，以数据驱动决策</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能分析与 DevTools","id":"性能分析与-devtools"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"React 性能分析工具概览","id":"react-性能分析工具概览"},{"level":2,"text":"React Profiler API","id":"react-profiler-api"},{"level":3,"text":"生产环境性能收集","id":"生产环境性能收集"},{"level":2,"text":"React DevTools Profiler","id":"react-devtools-profiler"},{"level":3,"text":"使用步骤","id":"使用步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"Flame Chart","id":"flame-chart"},{"level":3,"text":"Ranked Chart","id":"ranked-chart"},{"level":3,"text":"高亮重渲染","id":"高亮重渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"why-did-you-render","id":"why-did-you-render"},{"level":2,"text":"Chrome Performance 面板","id":"chrome-performance-面板"},{"level":3,"text":"关键指标","id":"关键指标"},{"level":3,"text":"录制分析流程","id":"录制分析流程"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化决策树","id":"性能优化决策树"},{"level":3,"text":"综合优化实践","id":"综合优化实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代码分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/code-splitting"},"next":null}